    "detailed_description": "\u25a0story<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe protagonist of the game, &quot;I&quot; is the most marginal character in the class<br />\r\n&quot;I&quot; do not know how to get along with people, do not know how to interact with people<br />\r\nEach day is wasted, muddled through, and deeply resentful of reality<br />\r\nAlways trying to escape reality, to have a dream that you can never wake up from<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUntil &quot;She&quot; came along<br />\r\nFocus on &quot;me&quot;, accompany &quot;me&quot;, accept &quot;me&quot;, hold &quot;my&quot; hand...<br />\r\nMy world has never been warmer<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBut &quot;I&quot; know that the real reality is harsh<br />\r\nWas it all a dream?<br />\r\nAfter that, what choice will I make?<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25a0feature<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a text adventure game that focuses on the psychological activities of the protagonist<br />\r\nYou can see all kinds of mental activities of the hero in the game<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25a0end<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game has three endings, two normal end and one true end",
